  clientName: Brooks
  jobDescription: Connect the market directly to Rivermere's main road with a bridge
    that safely carries taxis and heavier delivery vehicles from one end to the other.
    Observe how the structure responds as moving loads cross the span.
  budget: 60000000
  liveLoadWeight: 50
  bridgeSpan: 58.09374
